diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..a8e078627
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Allow a comma in a regular expression quantifier (such as ``(foo{1,3})``) for options
+of type ``regexp_csv`` like ``bad-names-rgxs``, instead of splitting the regular expression
+on it and crashing. A comma can also be escaped with a backslash.
+
+Closes #7229
